# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. Without the last-writer-wins
# merge the replicas keep whichever write arrived last, which differs by cluster.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceDeliverOverwrites
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the receiver installs a delivered write instead of merging it, so an older write replaces a newer one
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
       IN /\ reg' = [reg EXCEPT ![e[2]] = Merge(@, AsReg(w))]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no merge.
       IN /\ reg' = [reg EXCEPT ![e[2]] = AsReg(w)]
--- END
